Just note that, to actually test this code, we need to call the function that contains this assert statement, otherwise the AssertionError will not be triggered.

It is also important to note that assertion statements are used for debugging purposes. In a production environment, it is generally a good practice to let your program fail gracefully rather than terminating it via an assertion error. Thus, it is not best practice to rely solely on assertions for program flow control.--------------------